I have a lot of tools in my shop, both handheld and power tools. I also have a lot of jigs I've purchased to make specific woodworking tasks easier. I generally have an opinion about each of them and, as I pick up new ones or dig out an existing one, I'll share my views (both praise and complaints) for many of them.
  
{% include 'ai-disclaimer.html' %}
{% include 'pagination-count.html' %}

<ul class="posts">
  {% for review in reviews %}
    <li>
      <h4>
        <a href="{{ review.url }}" style="cursor: pointer">{{ review.data.title }}</a>
      </h4>
      <strong>Posted:</strong>&nbsp;
      {%- if review.data.timestamp %}
        {{ review.data.timestamp | readableTimestamp }}
      {%- else %}
        {{ review.date | readableDate }}
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if review.data.categories.length > 0 %}
        &nbsp;in 
        {% for cat in review.data.categories %}
          <a href="/categories/{{ cat | slugify }}">{{ cat }}</a>
          {%- unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
        {%- endfor %}
      <br/>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if review.data.description %}
        {% include 'description.html' %}
      {% else %}
        {% excerpt review %}
      {% endif %}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

